            "id": 127141,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi saat kita memanggil fungsi di Swift?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kode di dalam fungsi dijalankan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Semua kode di dalam fungsi disimpan dalam sebuah variabel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Loop while dibuat di dalam fungsi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kode di dalam fungsi dijalankan.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling the function",
            "id": 127142,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Selesaikan pemanggilan fungsi dengan menuliskan namanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayCash\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" money = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currency = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Euros&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(money, currency)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayCash()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"100\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100 Euros\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>displayCash</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Braces",
            "id": 127143,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>365</code> pada satu baris dan <code>Days a year</code> pada baris berikutnya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>365</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>365</code> pada satu baris dan <code>Days a year</code> pada baris berikutnya.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 127144,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa parameter dalam fungsi ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(user: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(text + user)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>user</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 127145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil fungsi tersebut dan teruskan sebuah nilai kepadanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(user: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(user: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"func\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>removeUser</code>, diikuti oleh <code>user:</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Lisa\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 127146,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk apa parameter digunakan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parameter membantu kita meneruskan informasi tertentu ke fungsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parameter memudahkan pemanggilan fungsi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Parameter memungkinkan kita mencetak variabel dalam print</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parameter membantu kita meneruskan informasi tertentu ke fungsi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 127147,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan parameter ke fungsi, lalu panggil fungsi tersebut dengan sebuah nilai.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(temp: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(temp)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(temp: \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>temp: Int</code>, diikuti oleh <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing a value ",
            "id": 127148,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Selesaikan pemanggilan fungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"totalWeight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(amount: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" measurement = \" /><text value=\"&quot;grams&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(amount, measurement)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"totalWeight(amount: \" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"101\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"250 grams\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>totalWeight</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
